{"suttaId":"tha-ap26","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[2924,2988],"vripara":"134"},"segments":{"tha-ap26:0.3":"Pañcasīlasamādāniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap26:1.1":"“Nagare candavatiyā, bhatako āsahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap26:1.3":"Parakammāyane yutto, pabbajjaṃ na labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap26:2.1":"“Mahandhakārapihitā, tividhaggīhi ḍayhare;","tha-ap26:2.3":"Kena nu kho upāyena, visaṃyutto bhave ahaṃ.","tha-ap26:3.1":"“Deyyadhammo ca me natthi, varāko bhatako ahaṃ;","tha-ap26:3.3":"Yaṃnūnāhaṃ pañcasīlaṃ, rakkheyyaṃ paripūrayaṃ.","tha-ap26:4.1":"“Anomadassissa munino, nisabho nāma sāvako;","tha-ap26:4.3":"Tamahaṃ upasaṅkamma, pañcasikkhāpadaggahiṃ.","tha-ap26:5.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","tha-ap26:5.3":"Tāvatā pañcasīlāni, paripuṇṇāni gopayiṃ.","tha-ap26:6.1":"“Maccukāle ca sampatte, devā assāsayanti maṃ;","tha-ap26:6.3":"‘Ratho sahassayutto te, mārisāyaṃ [mārisassa (ka.)] upaṭṭhito’.","tha-ap26:7.1":"“Vattante carime citte, mama sīlaṃ anussariṃ;","tha-ap26:7.3":"Tena kammena sukatena, tāvatiṃsaṃ agacchahaṃ.","tha-ap26:8.1":"“Tiṃsakkhattuñca devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap26:8.3":"Dibbasukhaṃ [dibbaṃ sukhaṃ (sī.)] anubhaviṃ, accharāhi purakkhato.","tha-ap26:9.1":"“Pañcasattatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap26:9.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap26:10.1":"“Devalokā cavitvāna, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap26:10.3":"Pure vesāliyaṃ jāto, mahāsāle suaḍḍhake.","tha-ap26:11.1":"“Vassūpanāyike kāle, dippante [dibbanti (ka.)] jinasāsane;","tha-ap26:11.3":"Mātā ca me pitā ceva, pañcasikkhāpadaggahuṃ.","tha-ap26:12.1":"“Saha sutvānahaṃ sīlaṃ, mama sīlaṃ anussariṃ;","tha-ap26:12.3":"Ekāsane nisīditvā, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap26:13.1":"“Jātiyā pañcavassena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","tha-ap26:13.3":"Upasampādayi buddho, guṇamaññāya cakkhumā.","tha-ap26:14.1":"“Paripuṇṇāni gopetvā, pañcasikkhāpadānahaṃ;","tha-ap26:14.3":"Aparimeyye ito kappe, vinipātaṃ na gacchahaṃ.","tha-ap26:15.1":"“Svāhaṃ yasamanubhaviṃ, tesaṃ sīlāna vāhasā;","tha-ap26:15.3":"Kappakoṭimpi kittento, kittaye ekadesakaṃ.","tha-ap26:16.1":"“Pañcasīlāni gopetvā, tayo hetū labhāmahaṃ;","tha-ap26:16.3":"Dīghāyuko mahābhogo, tikkhapañño bhavāmahaṃ.","tha-ap26:17.1":"“Saṃkittento ca [pakittentova (sī.), pakittente ca (syā.)] sabbesaṃ, abhimattañca porisaṃ;","tha-ap26:17.3":"Bhavābhave saṃsaritvā, ete ṭhāne labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap26:18.1":"“Aparimeyyasīlesu, vattantā jinasāvakā;","tha-ap26:18.3":"Bhavesu yadi rajjeyyuṃ, vipāko kīdiso bhave.","tha-ap26:19.1":"“Suciṇṇaṃ me pañcasīlaṃ, bhatakena tapassinā [vipassinā (sī.)];","tha-ap26:19.3":"Tena sīlenahaṃ ajja, mocayiṃ sabbabandhanā.","tha-ap26:20.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, pañcasīlāni gopayiṃ;","tha-ap26:20.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pañcasīlānidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap26:21.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap26:21.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap26:22.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pañcasīlasamādāniyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap26:23.1":"Pañcasīlasamādāniyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2358,"to":2361,"paras":[{"para":2358,"vripara":"134","refs":["tha-ap26:1"],"lines":["So attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto udānavasena pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>nagare candavatiyā</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Bhatako āsahaṃ tadā</b>ti tadā mama puññakaraṇakāle ahaṃ bhatako bhatiyā kammakārako āsiṃ ahosiṃ.","<b>Parakammāyane yutto</b>ti bhatiyā paresaṃ kammakaraṇe āyutto yojito okāsābhāvena saṃsārato muccanatthāya ahaṃ pabbajjaṃ na labhāmi."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap26:1"],["tha-ap26:1"],["tha-ap26:1"]]},{"para":2359,"vripara":"135","refs":["tha-ap26:2"],"lines":["<b>Mahandhakārapihitā</b>ti mahantehi kilesandhakārehi pihitā saṃvutā thakitā.","<b>Tividhaggīhi ḍayhare</b>ti narakaggipetaggisaṃsāraggisaṅkhātehi tīhi aggīhi ḍayhanti.","Ahaṃ pana kena upāyena kena kāraṇena visaṃyutto bhaveyyanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap26:2"],["tha-ap26:2"],["tha-ap26:2"]]},{"para":2360,"vripara":"136","refs":["tha-ap26:3"],"lines":["<b>Deyyadhammo</b> annapānādidātabbayuttakaṃ vatthu mayhaṃ natthi, tassābhāvena ahaṃ <b>varāko</b> dukkhito <b>bhatako</b> bhatiyā jīvanako <b>yaṃnūnāhaṃ pañcasīlaṃ rakkheyyaṃ paripūrayan</b>ti pañcasīlaṃ samādiyitvā paripūrento yaṃnūna rakkheyyaṃ sādhukaṃ bhaddakaṃ sundaraṃ katvā paripāleyyanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap26:3"]]},{"para":2361,"vripara":"148","refs":["tha-ap26:15"],"lines":["<b>Svāhaṃ yasamanubhavin</b>ti so ahaṃ devamanussesu mahantaṃ yasaṃ anubhaviṃ tesaṃ sīlānaṃ vāhasā ānubhāvenāti attho.","Kappakoṭimpi tesaṃ sīlānaṃ phalaṃ kittento ekakoṭṭhāsameva <b>kittaye</b> pākaṭaṃ kareyyanti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap26:15"],["tha-ap26:15"],["tha-ap26:15"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap26:1.1","nagare candavatiyā",0,0],["tha-ap26:1.1","bhatako āsahaṃ tadā",0,1],["tha-ap26:1.3","parakammāyane yutto",0,2],["tha-ap26:2.1","mahandhakārapihitā",1,0],["tha-ap26:2.1","tividhaggīhi ḍayhare",1,1],["tha-ap26:3.1","bhatako",2,0],["tha-ap26:3.1","deyyadhammo",2,0],["tha-ap26:3.1","varāko",2,0],["tha-ap26:3.3","yaṃnūnāhaṃ pañcasīlaṃ rakkheyyaṃ paripūrayaṃ",2,0],["tha-ap26:15.1","svāhaṃ yasamanubhaviṃ",3,0],["tha-ap26:15.3","kittaye",3,1]]},"tika":null}
